 "title": "Recorder | Benton County",
 "text": "-->\nRecorder | Benton County\ntop of page\nSkip to Main Content\nBENTON COUNTY\nAbout\nWelcome\nCommunity\nDepartments\nContact\nBusiness Info\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nCounty Government\nAll Departments\nRecorder\nThe recorder maintains and preserves all legal documents affecting title to real property. These records are the legal basis for determining ownership. We also record many other types of documents ranging from Deeds and Mortgages to Assumed Business Names and Military Discharges.\nOur dedicated staff is committed to providing you with fast and accurate assistance with your recording needs. For your convenience we added the ability to accept credit/debit cards.\nNo Legal Advice Will Be Given by the Recorder's Staff Either in Person or by Telephone.\nSome Benton County property owners have received an official looking solicitation letter from a company named LOCAL RECORDS OFFICE in Indianapolis. This company offers to sell you a copy of your deed for an extremely inflated price of $109.50 or more. Please know that copy of your deed can be obtained from the county Recorders office at $1.00 per page or online at doxpop.com .\nAlthough the office went live on computers July 1, 2002, we have diligently worked to back scan and index all deeds, Easements from April 1977 to current date and Mortgages from 1992 to current date so that they are available online. Documents are available on www.doxpop.com when you create an account.\nE-Recordings are accepted through either Simplifile at www.simplifile.com or CSC at www.erecording.com .\nWe look forward to serving you.\nGlenda Wallpe\nBenton County Recorder\nAll online sites for prefillable deeds are not affiliated with or endorsed by Benton County Government . For the preparation of deeds or other legal documents involving real property the public is strongly encouraged to consult a licensed attorney or title company to ensure their legal and property interests are protected. Benton County Government employees cannot provide legal advice or prepare legal documents.\nlowtaxinfo.com\nLOCATION\n706 E 5th Street; Suite 24 Fowler, IN 47944\nBenton County Courthouse\n(2nd Floor)\nHOURS\nMonday - Friday\n8:30 am to 4:00 pm EST\nClosed on major holidays\nCONTACT\nPH: 765-884-1630\nFax: 765-884-2013\nADDITIONAL LINKS\nState of Indiana Website\nE-Recordings: we are currently accepting documents for e-recordings\nwww.simplifile.com\nwww.erecording.com\nADDITIONAL DOCUMENTS\nApplications, Permits, and Zoning\nFee Sheet 2021\neffective January 1, 2021\nSales Disclosure\nhttps://www.in.gov/dlgf/assessments/sales-disclosure-form-information/\nCertificate of Assumed Business\nAmendment Certificate of Assumed Business Name\nTermination of Assumed Business Name\nSTAFF\nGlenda Wallpe, Recorder\ngwallpe@bentoncounty.in.gov\nHanna Guimond, Chief Deputy Recorder\nhguimond@bentoncounty.in.gov\nTOWNSHIP TRUSTEES\nAll Departments\nBENTON COUNTY COURTHOUSE\n706 E 5th Street\nFowler, IN 47944\nHours of Operation\nGENERAL NAVIGATION\nAbout\n​\nContact\n​\nCovid-19 Updates\n​\nEducation / Schools\n​\nGovernment\n​\nHistory\n​\nHome\n​\nJob Openings\n​\nPermits\n​\nUtilities\n​\nVoting Information\n​\nWelcome\n​\nCarbon Sequestration\nCOMMUNITY RESOURCES\nSee Also Community Departments\nADA & Title VI Resources\nLocal Experiences\nBusiness Directory\nEvents\n​\nHealth Department\n​\nLibraries\n​\nVeterans Affairs\nDEPARTMENTS\nAdministration\nAssessor​\nAuditor​\n​\nCentral Committees\n​\nCounty Clerk​\n​\nCommissioners​\n​\nCounty Council​\n​\nRecorder​\n​\nTreasurer\nCommunity\n​\nADA & Title VI Resources\nChamber of Commerce\n​\nBe In Benton\n​\nCooperative Extension Service ​\n​\nEconomic Development Department\n​\nBenton County Tourism\n​\nFamily & Children Division\n​\nRetirement Village\n​\nVeterans Affairs\nDEPARTMENTS\nHealth & Safety\n​\nDispatch - 911\n​\nEmergency Medical Services (EMS​)\n​\nHealth Department\n​\nHomeland Security &\nEmergency Mgt.​\n​\nSheriff's Department\n& Jail\nInfrastructure\n​\nAdvisory Plan\nCommission\nBuilding Inspector​\n​\nHighway Department\n​\nSoil / Water Conservation\n​\nSurveyor\nJustice\nCircuit Court\nProbation\nProsecuting Attorney\nOUR COMMUNITIES\nTown of Ambia\n​\nTown of Boswell\n​\nTown of Earl Park\n​\nTown of Fowler\n​\nTown of Otterbein\n​\nTown of Oxford\nHELPFUL LINKS\nSmart911 SignUp & LogIn\n​\nGIS Mapping: For property aerial maps, parcel assessment, and tax info.\n​\n2021 Indiana Municipal Guide\n​\nGuide to Securing your Home\n​\nVoter Information\n​\nIndiana Voter Portal\n​\nIndiana Office of Energy Development\n​\n2018 Benton County Comprehensive Plan\n​\nBest Colleges in Indiana 2022\n2025 Benton County Indiana All Rights Reserved\nWebmaster: Signature Web Creations\nbottom of page",
